42
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:21,700
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Return of the</font>

43
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:21,700
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Morning Mist</font>

44
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My mother and my father...
They didn't have to die.</font>

45
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I didn't have strength,
the whole clan was destroyed.</font>

46
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone was killed...</font>

47
00:02:57,110 --> 00:02:58,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

48
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:05,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morning training is over!</font>

49
00:03:18,170 --> 00:03:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once I've eaten breakfast</font>

50
00:03:19,380 --> 00:03:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get back to rigorous training!</font>

51
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man...</font>

52
00:03:34,230 --> 00:03:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru...</font>

53
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo! Konohamaru.</font>

54
00:03:44,410 --> 00:03:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto nii-chan.</font>

55
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you already resumed studies
at the academy?</font>

56
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:51,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No, not yet.</font>

57
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The school buildings are damaged,
so we're all repairing them.</font>

58
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:56,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

59
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about you, Naruto nii-chan?
You're already training?</font>

60
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:03,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sort of.</font>

61
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:11,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What?</font>

62
00:04:11,730 --> 00:04:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

63
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No, it's nothing...</font>

64
00:04:17,230 --> 00:04:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey um...!
— Hey um...!</font>

65
00:04:19,110 --> 00:04:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what is it...?</font>

66
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too, nii-chan, what is it?</font>

67
00:04:25,490 --> 00:04:27,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing... really...</font>

68
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't feel lonely.</font>

69
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

70
00:04:33,790 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time to be feeling lonely.</font>

71
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone is working really hard
to rebuild the village right now.</font>

72
00:04:43,550 --> 00:04:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru...</font>

73
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, I must work for
the village even just a little bit.</font>

74
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:52,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So nii-chan, you work hard
at your training too.</font>

75
00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't,
I'll become Hokage before you.</font>

76
00:04:56,440 --> 00:05:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool, I will absolutely become Hokage.</font>

77
00:05:00,820 --> 00:05:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides... you have to graduate
from the Academy first.</font>

78
00:05:05,950 --> 00:05:07,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right...</font>

79
00:05:09,370 --> 00:05:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, here it is.</font>

80
00:05:10,870 --> 00:05:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, it's for you.</font>

81
00:05:12,450 --> 00:05:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A free ramen ticket from Ichiraku...</font>

82
00:05:14,710 --> 00:05:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it okay?</font>

83
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:20,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already have one,
so I'm giving one to you.</font>

84
00:05:20,590 --> 00:05:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Naruto nii-chan.</font>

85
00:05:22,420 --> 00:05:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Konohamaru-chan.</font>

86
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:25,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good morning.</font>

87
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to go.</font>

88
00:05:28,430 --> 00:05:29,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll work hard again today.</font>

89
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yep!
— Yep!</font>

90
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today we're fixing the blackboards.</font>

91
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:35,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I brought paint.</font>

92
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:41,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! Once I've eaten ramen at Ichiraku,
I'll continue training.</font>

93
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is it.</font>

94
00:05:58,710 --> 00:05:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-This is...</font>

95
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:06,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lot of time has passed since the death.</font>

96
00:06:07,050 --> 00:06:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably before
the Chunin Exam began.</font>

97
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, so that's it...</font>

98
00:06:15,730 --> 00:06:18,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Orochimaru!</font>

99
00:06:22,230 --> 00:06:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After the murder of Kazekage-sama,</font>

100
00:06:24,530 --> 00:06:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru... or someone
like Kabuto played Kazekage-sama...</font>

101
00:06:29,910 --> 00:06:31,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How thoughtless we were...</font>

102
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That damn Sarutobi...</font>

103
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's not that easy.</font>

104
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:47,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one who was your opponent
was the renowned Hokage,</font>

105
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">deemed to be strongest of
all five great nations.</font>

106
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... you've done well.
Two out of the five Kage...</font>

107
00:06:55,350 --> 00:06:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop...</font>

108
00:06:57,890 --> 00:07:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop giving me words of sympathy.</font>

109
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will kill you!</font>

110
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:11,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, I didn't mean to...</font>

111
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:13,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true that we didn't succeed
in bringing the village down...</font>

112
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:20,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the other hand, another objective
of this plan, Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

113
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:24,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your leash is now on him.</font>

114
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In exchange for these arms
and all of my Jutsu...</font>

115
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:38,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we could have gotten our hands
on that Uchiha Itachi from the beginning,</font>

116
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it wouldn't have been a problem.</font>

117
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:44,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However that's a dream that
can no longer come true.</font>

118
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is stronger than I am.</font>

119
00:07:53,450 --> 00:07:59,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is why... I pulled myself out
from that organization...</font>

120
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi, huh?</font>

121
00:08:14,550 --> 00:08:15,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does he want?</font>

122
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Breakfast, breakfast!</font>

123
00:08:19,970 --> 00:08:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait for me, my ramen.</font>

124
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you already know
his whereabouts?</font>

125
00:08:31,780 --> 00:08:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

126
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case, it will be easy...</font>

127
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:37,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

128
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it comes, here it comes.</font>

129
00:08:43,410 --> 00:08:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh goodie, it's just like I thought.</font>

130
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden Leaf Village...
has a high average score.</font>

131
00:08:52,090 --> 00:08:55,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still doing such
a ridiculous thing?</font>

132
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well yes, this is my research.</font>

133
00:08:59,850 --> 00:09:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old Man Homura and Koharu-sensei, huh?</font>

134
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what you advisers
want from me.</font>

135
00:09:07,610 --> 00:09:09,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surely, you know...</font>

136
00:09:09,690 --> 00:09:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without our telling you, don't you?</font>

137
00:09:20,950 --> 00:09:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to make
such scary faces.</font>

138
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:26,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard that the talks with Sand Village
have been settled without problems.</font>

139
00:09:27,710 --> 00:09:29,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hidden Village in the Sand
announced that</font>

140
00:09:29,250 --> 00:09:32,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">everything was Orochimaru's handiwork.</font>

141
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:38,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition, at the moment of their
complete surrender to us, the Leaf Village,</font>

142
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:41,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that wasn't a very important issue
any more.</font>

143
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Village has no choice but
to accept their surrender and proposition</font>

144
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to restore national power.</font>

145
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, the current strength of
Leaf Village has dropped drastically.</font>

146
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Under these conditions,</font>

147
00:09:55,610 --> 00:10:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">our top priority must be to prepare
for any unpredicted crisis.</font>

148
00:10:00,990 --> 00:10:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know when any of
the neighboring nations</font>

149
00:10:03,620 --> 00:10:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will come out in a bold move.</font>

150
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, we've decided that until
the village gets its strength back,</font>

151
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:12,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we should assemble the top few men
from each troop,</font>

152
00:10:12,210 --> 00:10:16,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and form an emergency
executive committee to handle this.</font>

153
00:10:18,090 --> 00:10:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But first...</font>

154
00:10:23,430 --> 00:10:26,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we need a strong, trustworthy leader.</font>

155
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can find the seeds of trouble
rolling around everywhere these days.</font>

156
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:32,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just Orochimaru.</font>

157
00:10:33,190 --> 00:10:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't have to go through
the trouble of informing me that.</font>

158
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I'll continue gathering materials.</font>

159
00:10:40,780 --> 00:10:43,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to tell you the basic plan.</font>

160
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need the Fifth Hokage right away.</font>

161
00:10:47,290 --> 00:10:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yesterday at an emergency meeting
with the feudal lord of the Land of Fire,</font>

162
00:10:52,670 --> 00:10:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we decided
it would be you, Jiraiya.</font>

163
00:10:57,010 --> 00:11:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, it's not my nature.</font>

164
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has been decided.</font>

165
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:06,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, if a Shinobi like you,
renowned as a Sannin, is not...</font>

166
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:07,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then who is?</font>

167
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want a Sannin,
there is one more left...</font>

168
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:16,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Tsunade.</font>

169
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:23,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Certainly that child probably
has that capability, but...</font>

170
00:11:23,870 --> 00:11:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, no one knows where she is.</font>

171
00:11:26,950 --> 00:11:30,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll find and bring her back.
If I do that there's no problem, right?</font>

172
00:11:31,170 --> 00:11:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

173
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wise one like Tsunade is meant to
be Hokage more than I, with no motivation.</font>

174
00:11:40,420 --> 00:11:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want to do?</font>

175
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.
We'll give it urgent consideration.</font>

176
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, we'll have three members
from ANBU Black Ops to accompany you</font>

177
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:51,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as the search unit for Tsunade.</font>

178
00:11:52,310 --> 00:11:57,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry, I won't escape from this.
The guards are not necessary.</font>

179
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

180
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:05,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is one guy that I want
to take with me on my trip.</font>

181
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've found an interesting egg...</font>

182
00:12:10,660 --> 00:12:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? That is absolutely strange.</font>

183
00:12:14,210 --> 00:12:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but if you don't have a ticket,
there's no ramen.</font>

184
00:12:17,170 --> 00:12:20,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, wait a minute!
I absolutely had one more.</font>

185
00:12:21,170 --> 00:12:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

186
00:12:22,170 --> 00:12:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The one that I gave Konohamaru,
was it the last?</font>

187
00:12:27,050 --> 00:12:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

188
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:35,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, my ramen!</font>

189
00:12:38,070 --> 00:12:39,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"Make-Out Paradise"</b></font>

190
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo, you two!</font>

191
00:12:44,410 --> 00:12:46,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You seem to be getting along well.</font>

192
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fool, Anko asked me to
buy rice dumplings. That's all.</font>

193
00:12:50,830 --> 00:12:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing here?</font>

194
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:59,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While I'm here to buy offerings,
I've made plans to meet here...</font>

195
00:13:00,250 --> 00:13:01,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with Sasuke.</font>

196
00:13:03,260 --> 00:13:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, it's rare that you wait for people.</font>

197
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is the offering to Obito?</font>

198
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Obito?</font>

199
00:13:11,310 --> 00:13:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... that's about right.</font>

200
00:13:20,610 --> 00:13:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi, it's strange for
you to be here first.</font>

201
00:13:24,490 --> 00:13:26,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... once in a while.</font>

202
00:13:34,790 --> 00:13:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't do natto
and sweet things.</font>

203
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... Is that so?</font>

204
00:13:50,010 --> 00:13:51,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

205
00:13:51,510 --> 00:13:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is absolutely positively strange!</font>

206
00:14:10,370 --> 00:14:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys aren't from the village...
Why in the world did you come?</font>

207
00:14:15,410 --> 00:14:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I haven't seen you for
a while Asuma-san, Kurenai-san.</font>

208
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you know about us,
are you former Leaf Shinobi?</font>

209
00:14:32,390 --> 00:14:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?!
— Huh?!</font>

210
00:14:33,930 --> 00:14:35,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You are?!</font>

211
00:14:46,490 --> 00:14:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph, without a doubt...</font>

212
00:14:50,610 --> 00:14:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha...</font>

213
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:54,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi.</font>

214
00:14:57,620 --> 00:14:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are acquaintances of Itachi-san?</font>

215
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so...</font>

216
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll introduce myself as well.</font>

217
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Hoshigaki Kisame.</font>

218
00:15:11,220 --> 00:15:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hereafter, I hope to be familiar with you.</font>

219
00:15:15,350 --> 00:15:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never mind later,
I'm going to beat you now!</font>

220
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:21,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi-san...</font>

221
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you're pretty unpopular
in the village too.</font>

222
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know you, too.</font>

223
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hoshigake Kisame,</font>

224
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:31,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">originally a Shinobi
of Hidden Village in the Mist.</font>

225
00:15:31,990 --> 00:15:35,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Suspected of national covert activities
and of killing a feudal lord,</font>

226
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:39,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a Rogue Ninja from Land of Water,
on the wanted list in all nations.</font>

227
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a major S-rank criminal
listed in the Bingo Book.</font>

228
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi, you have some nerve
coming back to this village</font>

229
00:15:52,890 --> 00:15:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after causing that awful incident.</font>

230
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma-san... Kurenai-san...</font>

231
00:15:57,810 --> 00:15:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't interfere with me.</font>

232
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't intend to kill you.</font>

233
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:07,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not a line for you,
who killed your comrades.</font>

234
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know there's no way
you'd come here</font>

235
00:16:10,690 --> 00:16:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without any clear purpose
in those suspicious appearance.</font>

236
00:16:16,490 --> 00:16:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you after?</font>

237
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy is pretty annoying.
Should we kill him?</font>

238
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't look like we are able
to leave the village so smoothly...</font>

239
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But don't overdo it,
your techniques tend to stand out.</font>

240
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're done for then.</font>

241
00:17:20,390 --> 00:17:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

242
00:17:22,890 --> 00:17:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu.</font>

243
00:17:32,610 --> 00:17:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pressing down with the tip of his sword...
What strength.</font>

244
00:17:39,490 --> 00:17:41,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My large sword, Shark Skin...</font>

245
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">doesn't cut, but lops it off!</font>

246
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kurenai... You're late.</font>

247
00:18:28,210 --> 00:18:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this...</font>

248
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's over!</font>

249
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genjutsu of that level doesn't work on me.</font>

250
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... Genjutsu Reversal?</font>

251
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kurenai!</font>

252
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:09,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time to look away.</font>

253
00:19:10,170 --> 00:19:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what's expected from you, Kurenai-san.</font>

254
00:19:12,710 --> 00:19:13,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

255
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:18,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"But" this is as far as it goes...</font>

256
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:20,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for you.</font>

257
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

258
00:19:37,190 --> 00:19:38,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style!</font>

259
00:19:43,570 --> 00:19:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Water Shark Bomb Jutsu!
— Water Shark Bomb Jutsu!</font>

260
00:19:50,210 --> 00:19:51,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The same Jutsu as me?!</font>

261
00:19:52,460 --> 00:19:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why have you shown up too?</font>

262
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I asked you to take care
of them earlier.</font>

263
00:20:00,090 --> 00:20:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I kinda felt uneasy, you know.</font>

264
00:20:03,430 --> 00:20:04,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow clones.</font>

265
00:20:06,010 --> 00:20:07,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hatake...</font>

266
00:20:07,850 --> 00:20:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi.</font>

267
00:20:12,890 --> 00:20:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... So much fuss for nothing.</font>

268
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:17,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

269
00:20:18,190 --> 00:20:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I put it under my headband</font>

270
00:20:20,110 --> 00:20:25,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order not to drop the important ticket
during morning training.</font>

271
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:31,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, that's fine...
Eat well and do your best.</font>

272
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:32,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

273
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:36,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to do it again
after this, right? Training?</font>

274
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course! I'm full of motivation.</font>

275
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good! Here you go.</font>

276
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:49,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another serving for free! Go for it!</font>

277
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, sir!</font>

278
00:20:53,890 --> 00:20:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome.</font>

279
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like I heard...
I had to come and see it.</font>

280
00:20:58,190 --> 00:21:01,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that you really
are just eating ramen.</font>

281
00:21:02,280 --> 00:21:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Pervy Sage!</font>

282
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">gaman no renzoku dattaro</font></font></b></font>

283
00:21:09,590 --> 00:21:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">a cycle of hardship, right?</font></font></b></font>

284
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">kokoro de naiteita ndarou</font></font></b></font>

285
00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">inside, we were crying, right?</font></font></b></font>

286
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">jibun de kimeta sono yume dake wa yuzurenai ndarou</font></font></b></font>

287
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font face="Veleka"><font color="#fefedf">but the one thing we won't give up is the dream we've chosen, right?</font></font></b></font>

288
00:21:27,650 --> 00:21:30,090
